{
  "module": "scene",
  "storyboard": "formats/scene/saas-hero-launch.storyboard.md",
  "_template": "FILLABLE TEMPLATE - a white-first SaaS launch film, cut into seven shots. Nothing here is anyone's brand: the product is the fictional 'Meridian', every colour is a theme token, and every mark is inline svg. To reskin, change `theme` (any file in themes/) and nothing else. To refill, replace the copy strings, the logoWall entries, the browserFrame rows, the barChart data and the four capability cards. What is worth keeping is the SHAPE: six cuts, one backdrop window per shot, one match cut, one word that swaps inside a fixed chip, and a bed the cuts are snapped to.",
  "orientation": "landscape",
  "theme": "default",
  "duration": 35,
  "audio": {
    "music": "assets/music/launch.wav",
    "musicGain": 0.4,
    "musicFade": {
      "in": 1.2,
      "out": 2
    },
    "auto": true,
    "sfxGain": 0.7,
    "loudness": -14,
    "beatSync": {
      "maxShift": 0.1
    },
    "_why": "The bed is the film's clock. beatSync snaps every cut to the track's pulse, and `auto` voices each cut from its own style (core/audio-cues.js), so a fork that swaps the bed re-times the edit for free."
